  "description": "Jin Haneul is a lower angel whose job is to erase bad memories and feelings from people. As Jin goes through this process of erasing burdens, Min Deule, his first love, appears. A forgotten first love, a bond that transcends space and time, and their intertwined feelings.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_sweetsky_wz), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3257349), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/50938298), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H038986522), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H038986522)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0C5LX7T1X/)",
